    "description": "Experience the rare opportunity to live, rent, and build real wealth in this expansive 3,732 sq ft duplex in the heart of Outer Richmond\u2014one of San Francisco\u2019s most iconic neighborhoods. This gem features two spacious, tenant-occupied units on the top and middle floors, each offering identical floor plans with two beds, one bath, a living room with fireplace, a dining room, a sun room, a kitchen, and access to the shared backyard. On the ground floor, a bonus 2-bed, 1-bath studio is move-in ready\u2014ideal for house hacking, multigenerational living, or creating your city pied-\u00e0-terre. Inside, natural light floods the living spaces that flow seamlessly from room to room, combining vintage character with modern comfort. Both upper units feature sweeping downtown views of San Francisco, with one including an additional den/home office. Additional highlights include a 2-car tandem garage with ample storage, a private fenced backyard for relaxing, and an unbeatable location near parks, trails, and everyday conveniences. Enjoy direct transit access to downtown, and proximity to the Presidio, Legion of Honor, Land\u2019s End, Sutro Baths, Ocean Beach, and the vibrant Richmond Village corridor. Golden Gate Park, Andronico\u2019s, and Golden Gate Bridge views are just minutes away."
  },
